{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1317050427"}, "name":{"label":"TSMLSP"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-31T05:15:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.33.1"}, "id":{"label":"14493637507"}, "title":{"label":"Genuine Customer Reviews Disappeared and Google Support Did Nothing"}, "content":{"label":"I am extremely disappointed with Google Maps and the way Google handles support for businesses.\n\nOur business received many genuine reviews from real customers who actually visited our café and shared their honest experiences. However, a large number of these reviews suddenly disappeared within a very short period of time, without any clear explanation.\n\nWhat is even more frustrating is that I have contacted Google repeatedly and sent numerous emails and support requests regarding this issue. I clearly explained the situation and asked Google to investigate the missing reviews. Despite all of these attempts, the issue has still not been properly resolved, and I have not received any meaningful explanation or effective assistance.\n\nFor a small business, every genuine review represents the time, effort, and care we put into serving our customers. It is incredibly unfair and frustrating to see legitimate customer reviews suddenly disappear while receiving little to no useful support after repeatedly asking for help.\n\nI am leaving this 1-star review so that other business owners are aware that this can happen. If your legitimate reviews suddenly disappear, even repeatedly contacting support and sending multiple emails may not result in a solution.\n\nGoogle needs to seriously improve both its review filtering system and its customer support for businesses. Business owners deserve transparency, proper investigation, and real assistance when issues like this occur.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=585027354&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
